{"unit_id":"EvieHe__dsh-resume-headless#card-zh","repo":"EvieHe/dsh-resume-headless","commit":"90a148a1219682c427070702e13c79f20489dd12","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-headless 是面向 DSH headless 命令行客户端的一次性会话恢复插件。它通过 bundle patch 替换官方 headless 的启动解析器和 runner，读取 --resume 会话编号，并将任务和编号交给恢复 runner。主要功能包括恢复持久化会话继续执行、未指定恢复编号时创建新会话、将会话编号写到标准错误以便后续续接，以及把最后的助手文本输出并按轮次结果设置退出码。适合希望通过脚本继续先前 headless DSH 任务的用户；需要安装在叠加官方 headless 插件的 profile 中。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:10-25","src/startup.ts:44-81","src/index.ts:108-136"]}
{"unit_id":"EvieHe__dsh-resume-headless#card-en","repo":"EvieHe/dsh-resume-headless","commit":"90a148a1219682c427070702e13c79f20489dd12","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-resume-headless lets the DSH headless CLI continue a saved session using --resume <id> and a new task. Without the option, it starts a fresh session. It prints the session id and final assistant text, then exits according to the turn result. The profile must include the official headless plugin.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:10-25","src/startup.ts:44-81","src/index.ts:108-136"]}
