{"unit_id":"EvieHe__dsh-resume-headless#feature-1","repo":"EvieHe/dsh-resume-headless","commit":"90a148a1219682c427070702e13c79f20489dd12","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-headless 的功能「从历史会话继续」：命令行提供 --resume 会话编号和任务文本时，runner 调用 agents.resume 恢复该会话，再把新任务作为用户消息提交并等待执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/startup.ts:44-59","src/index.ts:108-130"]}
{"unit_id":"EvieHe__dsh-resume-headless#feature-2","repo":"EvieHe/dsh-resume-headless","commit":"90a148a1219682c427070702e13c79f20489dd12","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-headless 的功能「无恢复参数时新建会话」：不传 --resume 时，runner 创建一个新的随机会话并执行输入任务，保持 headless 一次性运行方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:108-119"]}
{"unit_id":"EvieHe__dsh-resume-headless#feature-3","repo":"EvieHe/dsh-resume-headless","commit":"90a148a1219682c427070702e13c79f20489dd12","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-headless 的功能「输出会话编号和本轮回答」：runner 将会话编号写入 stderr，将本轮最后的助手文本写入 stdout，完成时请求以成功码退出，其他轮次结果请求以失败码退出。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:121-136"]}
{"unit_id":"EvieHe__dsh-resume-headless#feature-4","repo":"EvieHe/dsh-resume-headless","commit":"90a148a1219682c427070702e13c79f20489dd12","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-headless 的功能「命令行帮助和参数检查」：启动参数包含 -h 或 --help 时显示用法；没有提供非空任务时向 stderr 提示任务必填并请求失败退出。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/startup.ts:27-35","src/startup.ts:66-81"]}
